# Validation Rules

## Before Every Commit

- No hardcoded styles; all sizes use `useResponsive`
- No unused imports or components
- No debug logs
- Formatting, lint, and TypeScript pass

## Required Commands

```bash
npm run format
npm run lint
npm run tsc
git status
```
